{
    "title": "Manticore - The Chairman",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_stand) == 2",
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 21 - The Chairman",
                "zh": "第二十一章 - 主席"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Vane's flagship is the last of the Board. Its guard is everything money could still buy. Take him alive if you can. The sector deserves a trial.",
                        "zh": "瓦恩的旗舰是董事会最后的家底。它的护卫是钱还能买到的一切。能抓活的就抓活的。这个星区应该有一场审判。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Every Manticore fighter is fuelled. Hayley, Khanna, Kyrrk's clan wing. Go end it.",
                        "zh": "蝎尾狮号的每一架战机都加满了油。海莉、坎娜、基尔克的氏族联队。去做个了结吧。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "chairman_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to the Halcyon Exchange.",
                "zh": "飞往哈尔西恩交易所。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 1,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Hayley"
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 1,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Khanna"
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 9,
            "race": "vossk",
            "count": 2,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Clan Wing"
        },
        {
            "type": "shipfollow",
            "ship": "Hayley",
            "leader": "player",
            "offset": "-800 0 -600",
            "escort": true
        },
        {
            "type": "shipfollow",
            "ship": "Khanna",
            "leader": "player",
            "offset": "800 0 -600",
            "escort": true
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Chairman Aurel Vane",
            "text": {
                "en": "You flew all this way to shoot at a balance sheet. Name your price, pilot. Everyone has one.",
                "zh": "你大老远飞来，就为了朝一张资产负债表开枪。开个价吧，飞行员。每个人都有价码。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
            "text": {
                "en": "Six years in a cell. That's the price. You can't pay it.",
                "zh": "在牢房里六年。这就是价码。你付不起。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Halcyon Guard",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 28,
                    "count": 3,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 22,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy the Chairman's guard.",
                "zh": "消灭主席的护卫。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Board Mercenary",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 63,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 54,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy the last mercenaries.",
                "zh": "消灭最后的雇佣兵。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Chairman Aurel Vane",
            "text": {
                "en": "Then I'll write you off.",
                "zh": "那我就把你们一笔勾销。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Chairman Vane",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 37,
                    "count": 1,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 38,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Disable Chairman Vane's flagship.",
                "zh": "击瘫瓦恩主席的旗舰。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:exchange",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Chairman Aurel Vane",
            "text": {
                "en": "Stop! I... surrender. My lawyers will be in touch.",
                "zh": "住手！我……投降。我的律师会联系你们的。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
            "text": {
                "en": "Your lawyers can visit you at Phoenix. Martha's people are building you a very nice cell.",
                "zh": "你的律师可以去凤凰站看你。玛莎的人正在给你造一间非常漂亮的牢房。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 80000,
            "title": {
                "en": "The Board has fallen",
                "zh": "董事会覆灭"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "vane_caught"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "THE END",
                "zh": "完"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Manticore: Neox Frontier",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号：尼奥克斯边境"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Sh'Gaal, Khador, Eclipse, the Board. We followed the money to the very top, and we're still flying. Not bad for a carrier nobody wanted.",
                        "zh": "希加尔、卡多尔、日蚀、董事会。我们顺着钱一路追到了最顶层，而且我们还在飞。对一艘没人要的航母来说，还不错。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The Foundry's Glow is inert. Given time, I can use it to stabilise the shattered worlds. Not rebuild them. Stop them from falling apart further.",
                        "zh": "铸造厂的光晶已经失活了。给我时间，我可以用它来稳定那些破碎的世界。不是重建，是不让它们再继续崩解。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "vossk Kyrrk Tasst",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "My clan has asked me to come home. I told them the Manticore is my clan now. They laughed. Then they sent supplies.",
                        "zh": "我的氏族让我回家。我告诉他们，蝎尾狮号现在就是我的氏族。他们笑了，然后送来了补给。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Hayley Snocom",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Commander, I'd like to fly for the Manticore. Properly, this time. With a Styx, if Saya can build one.",
                        "zh": "指挥官，我想为蝎尾狮号飞。这一次是正式的。开冥河号，如果萨娅造得出来的话。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Saya",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "I already started. Took me six years.",
                        "zh": "我早就开始造了。造了六年。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then welcome home, Snocom. And you, ace, whatever this frontier throws at us next, the Manticore flies with you.",
                        "zh": "那就欢迎回家，斯诺科姆。还有你，王牌，不管这片边境接下来给我们扔来什么，蝎尾狮号都和你一起飞。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 100000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Manticore: Neox Frontier complete",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号：尼奥克斯边境 完结"
            }
        }
    ]
}
